<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Collective Bancorp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Collective Bancorp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Bruce Harting said he initiated coverage of Collective Bancorp Inc with an outperform rating and 12-month price target of $30-$31.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Collective offers strong fundamental operating prospects which include bank-like ROEs, efficient operations and excellent asset quality. Share repurchases will also help to enhance share value,&quot; Harting said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 27-1/2.</p>
</text>
